DISAMBIGUATION RULES (CRITICAL)
-------------------------------
- "tumulus", "hut", "shelter", "stonering", "fireplace" etc. are ONLY Feature.Category -- NEVER Site.Category.
- "big ruins", "rock arts" are ONLY Site.Category.
- For shared values ("graves", "campsite", "habitation site", "well"), default to Feature.Category unless the question explicitly refers to Sites.
- "ridge", "terrace", "slope", "khor", "plain" etc. are Location1 values -- NEVER categories. Location1 exists on BOTH Feature AND Site nodes.
